            <history xml:id="history_idec23dd9b">
               <p xml:id="idm150">In 1877 Gade wrote a string quartet which was never published. Twelve years later he wrote to his publisher Breitkopf &amp; Härtel that he intended to send him two new quartets to make a trilogy together with the D minor quartet already published. He therefore heavily revised the earlier manuscript; however, the new version was neither published during his own life-time.</p>
            </history>
